#
# Validation and private key
#
ConfirmValidateCampaignTitle = Validate the campaign
ConfirmValidateCampaignText = Validating permanently freezes the campaign: dates, tag, group, voters and their points can no longer be changed. A keypair is generated; the private key will be shown once right after, and is not kept anywhere by Dolibarr. Without it the campaign can neither start nor be tallied. Confirm?
PrivateKeyWarningTitle = Campaign private key -- save it now
PrivateKeyWarningText = This key is shown only once and is not stored anywhere by Dolibarr: without it the campaign can neither start nor be tallied. Copy it or download it before leaving this page.
PrivateKeyLabel = Private key (base64)
CopyPrivateKey = Copy
CopyPrivateKeyDone = Key copied to clipboard
DownloadPrivateKey = Download (.key)
DeleteCampaign = Delete campaign

#
# Tie-break rule, fixed at validation and part of the genesis hash
#
CampaignTieRuleTitle = Tie-break rule
CampaignTieRule_B_E = Share of budget, then verifiable draw
CampaignTieRuleExplanation = In case of a tie on points for a thirdparty: 1) the voter who committed the largest share of their own budget (points bid / points allocated) wins; 2) if still tied, a verifiable draw, derived from the final hash of the vote chain and the thirdparty id, that anyone can recompute. This rule is fixed at validation time and recorded in the genesis hash.

