#
# Errors
#
ErrorCampaignNotDraft = The campaign is no longer a draft.
ErrorCampaignNotDraftCannotBeModified = The campaign is validated: it can no longer be modified.
ErrorCampaignNotDraftCannotBeDeleted = Only a draft campaign can be deleted.
ErrorCampaignOnlyCreatorCanValidate = Only the campaign creator can validate it.
ErrorCampaignDateEndBeforeStart = The end date must be after the start date.
ErrorCampaignDateEndInPast = The end date must be after the current date and time.
ErrorCampaignCategoryMandatory = The customer tag is mandatory.
ErrorCampaignCategoryNotFound = The selected customer tag could not be found.
ErrorCampaignCategoryWrongType = The selected tag is not a customer tag.
ErrorCampaignCategoryWrongEntity = The selected customer tag does not belong to this entity.
ErrorCampaignNoThirdparty = The campaign has no thirdparty: sync with the tag.
ErrorCampaignThirdpartyNotFound = Thirdparty #%s no longer exists in Dolibarr: sync with the tag again.
ErrorCampaignGroupMandatory = The voters group is mandatory.
ErrorCampaignGroupNotFound = The selected voters group could not be found.
ErrorCampaignGroupWrongEntity = The selected voters group does not belong to this entity.
ErrorCampaignNoVoter = The campaign has no voter.
ErrorCampaignVoterPointsNotPositive = Points of %s must be greater than zero.
ErrorCampaignCreatorNotVoter = The campaign manager must be among the voters.
ErrorCampaignVoterMissingKeys = Invalid voter: missing campaign or user.
ErrorCampaignGenesisPayloadEncoding = Internal error: the genesis payload could not be encoded.
ErrorCampaignValidationWriteFailed = Validation could not be written to the database: nothing was changed.
ErrorSalonerpSodiumExtensionMissing = The PHP sodium extension is required by this module (campaign keypair generation) and is missing on this server.
